\item exponential: \eqn{-1/\mu^2}; geometric: \eqn{-1/(\mu(1+\mu))};
\item chi-squared: \eqn{-\psi'(\mu/2)/4};
\item Cauchy, logistic and Gumbel: every component a constant over
